   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 3,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:13",
   "text": "Clean comparison. Logging the first one's pattern.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 4,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-06 19:14",
   "text": "Same trip: Odd group of three: the only thing all of them have in common is one pattern, and that pattern is precisely what I avoid.",
