  },
  {
   "turn_id": 19,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:13",
   "text": "With the rest controlled, the first one's garment type is out.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 20,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:14",
   "text": "She also sent this: Same piece, two colors. The second one is the version I'd actually wear.",
